<title>GERMANY: Kuehne &amp; Nagel names new managers.</title>
<headline>Kuehne &amp; Nagel names new managers.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global forwarder Kuehne &amp; Nagel AG has appointed new managers for its subsidiaries in Britain, Taiwan and Thailand with effect from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The new U.K. managing director is Jan Lyngdam, formerly in charge of the Hong Kong division, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Andreas Weber, currently national manager for Taiwan, will become the new Hong Kong manager, it added.</p>
<p>Thomas Lehmann, national manager Thailand, takes over in Taiwan and will be replaced by Shanghai manager Stephan Danne. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
